@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] soundbank-default-and-coverage
Original MUST remain selection zero and delegate to the existing audio assets,
mix and playback behavior. Generated banks MUST explicitly cover every footstep,
surface roll, surface landing and powerslide cue. Every other declared cue family
MUST explicitly inherit Original; missing data MUST NOT silently empty a cue.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] committed-soundbank-admission
Generated bank manifests and consumed WAVs MUST be committed game assets with
verified checksums and generation/processing provenance. Source WAVs MUST be
bounded canonical mono 48 kHz PCM16, non-silent and unclipped. Invalid coverage,
paths, event/loop timing or budgets MUST fail before output publication.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] soundbank-product-publication
Preparation MUST publish complete immutable media before its index, recheck
source identities before publication, and preserve the previously published index
and referenced bytes on failure. The normal build MUST inventory all products
and declare every consumed source. Validation MUST NOT imply listening acceptance.
